\q1 \v 20 \rb His beautiful|וּצְבִ֤י\rb* \rb ornaments|עֶדְיוֹ֙\rb*
\q2 \rb they transformed|שָׂמָ֔הוּ\rb* \rb into pride|לְגָא֣וֹן\rb*
