\q1 \rb Therefore|עַל־\rb*\rb |כֵּ֛ן\rb* \rb I will make these|נְתַתִּ֥יו\rb*
\q2 \rb into something unclean|לְנִדָּֽה׃\rb* \rb for them|לָהֶ֖ם\rb*.
\q1 \v 21 \rb And I will hand these things over|וּנְתַתִּ֤יו\rb*\rb |בְּיַֽד־\rb*
\q2 \rb as plunder|לָבַ֔ז\rb* \rb to foreigners|הַזָּרִים֙\rb*
\q1 \rb and loot|לְשָׁלָ֑ל\rb* \rb to the wicked|וּלְרִשְׁעֵ֥י\rb* \rb of the earth|הָאָ֖רֶץ\rb*,
\q2 \rb who will defile them|וְחִלְּלֻהָ׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 22 \rb I will turn|וַהֲסִבּוֹתִ֤י\rb* \rb My face|פָנַי֙\rb* \rb away from them|מֵהֶ֔ם\rb*,
\q2 \rb and they will defile|וְחִלְּל֖וּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb My treasured place|צְפוּנִ֑י\rb*.
\q1 \rb Violent men|פָּרִיצִ֖ים\rb* \rb will enter|וּבָאוּ־\rb* \rb it|בָ֥הּ\rb*,
\q2 \rb and they will defile it|וְחִלְּלֽוּהָ׃פ\rb*.
\b 
\q1 \v 23 \rb Forge|עֲשֵׂ֖ה\rb* \rb the chain|הָֽרַתּ֑וֹק\rb*,
\q2 \rb for|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb the land|הָאָ֗רֶץ\rb* \rb is full|מָֽלְאָה֙\rb* \rb of crimes|מִשְׁפַּ֣ט\rb* \rb of bloodshed|דָּמִ֔ים\rb*,
\q2 \rb and the city|וְהָעִ֖יר\rb* \rb is full|מָלְאָ֥ה\rb* \rb of violence|חָמָֽס׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 24 \rb So I will bring|וְהֵֽבֵאתִי֙\rb* \rb the most wicked|רָעֵ֣י\rb* \rb of nations|גוֹיִ֔ם\rb*
\q2 \rb to take possession of|וְיָרְשׁ֖וּ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb their houses|בָּֽתֵּיהֶ֑ם\rb*.
\q1 \rb I will end|וְהִשְׁבַּתִּי֙\rb* \rb the pride|גְּא֣וֹן\rb* \rb of the mighty|עַזִּ֔ים\rb*,
\q2 \rb and their holy places|מְקַֽדְשֵׁיהֶֽם׃\rb* \rb will be profaned|וְנִחֲל֖וּ\rb*.
