\q1 \v 26 \rb Disaster|הֹוָ֤ה\rb* \rb upon|עַל־\rb* \rb disaster|הֹוָה֙\rb* \rb will come|תָּב֔וֹא\rb*,
\q2 \rb and|תִּֽהְיֶ֑ה\rb* \rb rumor|וּשְׁמֻעָ֥ה\rb* \rb after|אֶל־\rb* \rb rumor|שְׁמוּעָ֖ה\rb*.
\q1 \rb Then they will seek|וּבִקְשׁ֤וּ\rb* \rb a vision|חָזוֹן֙\rb* \rb from a prophet|מִנָּבִ֔יא\rb*,
\q2 \rb but instruction|וְתוֹרָה֙\rb* \rb from the priests|מִכֹּהֵ֔ן\rb* \rb will perish|תֹּאבַ֣ד\rb*,
\q2 \rb as will counsel|וְעֵצָ֖ה\rb* \rb from the elders|מִזְּקֵנִֽים׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 27 \rb The king|הַמֶּ֣לֶךְ\rb* \rb will mourn|יִתְאַבָּ֗ל\rb*,
