\q2 \rb and the hands|וִידֵ֥י\rb* \rb of the people|עַם־\rb* \rb of the land|הָאָ֖רֶץ\rb* \rb will tremble|תִּבָּהַ֑לְנָה\rb*.
\q1 \rb I will deal|אֶעֱשֶׂ֤ה\rb* \rb with them|אוֹתָם֙\rb* \rb according to their conduct|מִדַּרְכָּ֞ם\rb*,
\q2 \rb and I will judge them|אֶשְׁפְּטֵ֔ם\rb* \rb by their own standards|וּבְמִשְׁפְּטֵיהֶ֣ם\rb*.
