\q2 \rb and I|אָ֔נִי\rb* \rb will plant it|וְשָׁתַ֣לְתִּי\rb* \rb on|עַ֥ל\rb* \rb a high|גָּבֹ֖הַ\rb* \rb and lofty|וְתָלֽוּל׃\rb* \rb mountain|הַר־\rb*.
