\s1 The Soul Who Sins Will Die
\p \v 1 \rb Then the word|דְבַר־\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb* \rb came|וַיְהִ֥י\rb* \rb to me|אֵלַ֥י\rb*, \rb saying|לֵאמֹֽר׃\rb*, \v 2 “\rb What|מַה־\rb* \rb do you people|אַתֶּם֙\rb* \rb mean|לָּכֶ֗ם\rb* \rb by quoting this|הַזֶּ֔ה\rb* \rb proverb|מֹֽשְׁלִים֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb*\rb |הַמָּשָׁ֣ל\rb* \rb about|עַל־\rb* \rb the land|אַדְמַ֥ת\rb* \rb of Israel|יִשְׂרָאֵ֖ל\rb*:\rb |לֵאמֹ֑ר\rb*
