\q1 \rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb He does not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb defile|טִמֵּ֔א\rb* \rb his neighbor’s|רֵעֵ֙הוּ֙\rb* \rb wife|אֵ֤שֶׁת\rb*
