\p \v 24 \rb Therefore|לָכֵ֗ן\rb* \rb this is what|כֹּֽה־\rb* \rb the Lord|אֲדֹנָ֣י\rb* \rb GOD|יְהוִה֒\rb* \rb says|אָמַר֮\rb*: ‘\rb Because|יַ֗עַן\rb* \rb you have drawn attention|הַזְכַּרְכֶם֙\rb* \rb to your guilt|עֲוֺ֣נְכֶ֔ם\rb*, \rb exposing|בְּהִגָּל֣וֹת\rb* \rb your transgressions|פִּשְׁעֵיכֶ֗ם\rb*, \rb so that your sins|חַטֹּ֣אותֵיכֶ֔ם\rb* \rb are revealed|לְהֵֽרָאוֹת֙\rb* \rb in all|בְּכֹ֖ל\rb* \rb your deeds|עֲלִילֽוֹתֵיכֶ֑ם\rb* — \rb because|יַ֚עַן\rb* \rb you have come to remembrance|הִזָּ֣כֶרְכֶ֔ם\rb* — \rb you shall be taken|תִּתָּפֵֽשׂוּ׃פ\rb* \rb in hand|בַּכַּ֖ף\rb*.
