\q2 \rb until|עַד־\rb* \rb the arrival|בֹּ֛א\rb* \rb of Him to whom|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb it belongs|ל֥וֹ\rb*,
\q2 \rb to whom I have assigned|וּנְתַתִּֽיו׃פ\rb* \rb the right of judgment|הַמִּשְׁפָּ֖ט\rb*.\f + \fr 21:27 \ft Or \fqa of Him to whom it rightfully belongs, to whom I have given it.\f*’
\p \v 28 \rb Now|וְאַתָּ֣ה\rb* \rb prophesy|הִנָּבֵ֤א\rb*, \rb son|בֶן־\rb* \rb of man|אָדָ֗ם\rb*, \rb and declare|וְאָֽמַרְתָּ֙\rb* \rb that this is what|כֹּ֤ה\rb* \rb the Lord|אֲדֹנָ֣י\rb* \rb GOD|יְהֹוִ֔ה\rb* \rb says|אָמַר֙\rb* \rb concerning|אֶל־\rb* \rb the Ammonites|בְּנֵ֥י\rb*\rb |עַמּ֖וֹן\rb*\rb |וְאֶל־\rb* \rb and their contempt|חֶרְפָּתָ֑ם\rb*\rb |וְאָמַרְתָּ֗\rb*:
