\p \v 19 \rb Therefore|לָכֵ֗ן\rb* \rb this is what|כֹּ֤ה\rb* \rb the Lord|אֲדֹנָ֣י\rb* \rb GOD|יְהוִ֔ה\rb* \rb says|אָמַר֙\rb*: ‘\rb Because|יַ֛עַן\rb* \rb all|כֻּלְּכֶ֖ם\rb* \rb of you have become|הֱי֥וֹת\rb* \rb dross|לְסִגִ֑ים\rb*,\rb |לָכֵן֙\rb* \rb behold|הִנְנִ֣י\rb*, \rb I will gather|קֹבֵ֣ץ\rb* \rb you|אֶתְכֶ֔ם\rb* \rb into|אֶל־\rb*\rb |תּ֖וֹךְ\rb* \rb Jerusalem|יְרוּשָׁלִָֽם׃\rb*. \v 20 \rb Just as one gathers|קְבֻ֣צַת\rb* \rb silver|כֶּ֡סֶף\rb*, \rb copper|וּ֠נְחֹשֶׁת\rb*, \rb iron|וּבַרְזֶ֨ל\rb*, \rb lead|וְעוֹפֶ֤רֶת\rb*, \rb and tin|וּבְדִיל֙\rb* \rb into|אֶל־\rb*\rb |תּ֣וֹךְ\rb* \rb the furnace|כּ֔וּר\rb* \rb to melt|לְהַנְתִּ֑יךְ\rb* \rb with a fiery|אֵ֖שׁ\rb* \rb blast|לָפַֽחַת־\rb*\rb |עָלָ֥יו\rb*, \rb so|כֵּ֤ן\rb* \rb I will gather|אֶקְבֹּץ֙\rb* \rb you in My anger|בְּאַפִּ֣י\rb* \rb and wrath|וּבַחֲמָתִ֔י\rb*, \rb leave you there|וְהִנַּחְתִּ֥י\rb*, \rb and melt|וְהִתַּכְתִּ֖י\rb* \rb you|אֶתְכֶֽם׃\rb*.
