\q2 \rb will abandon|וְֽיָרְד֞וּ\rb* \rb their ships|מֵאָנִיּֽוֹתֵיהֶ֗ם\rb*.
\q1 \rb The sailors|מַלָּחִ֕ים\rb* \rb and all|כֹּ֖ל\rb* \rb the captains|חֹבְלֵ֣י\rb* \rb of the sea|הַיָּ֑ם\rb*
\q2 \rb will stand|יַעֲמֹֽדוּ׃\rb* \rb on|אֶל־\rb* \rb the shore|הָאָ֖רֶץ\rb*.
